 false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVVejLl6.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/wallstreetapes/status/2105715255255121995", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Chicago Mayor Brandon Johnson\u2019s office released the city\u2019s official 2027 Budget Forecast predicting an $882 million dollar DEFICIT. Meanwhile, Chicago\u2019s Inspector General found $640 million was spent on illegals.", "last_comment_created": 1791140173064, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 8, "score_up": 315, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 169, "created": 1790876613000, "id": "2105715255255121995", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1593753619148382208/YYzzCs6C_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Wall Street Apes", "username": "WallStreetApes"}, "content": "NEW: Chicago Mayor Brandon Johnson\u2019s office released the city\u2019s official 2027 Budget Forecast predicting an $882 million dollar deficit\n\nChicago\u2019s Inspector General reviewed spending from August 31, 2022 through December 31, 2024 and found $640 million spent on illegal migrants", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 4318}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVVejteq", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 156, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8869758, "raw_content": "(to meet legal standards and many of those standards should be eliminated.)\n\nThere is a huge and growing boutique industry centered around classic vehicles that were exceptionally popular.  Most of these are either reconditions or totally new chassis and body panels paired w/ LS and sometimes Coyote engines.  These are generally highly equipped and very pricey.\n\nHowever, manufacturing true retro with limited options would be a huge profit center for the Big 3.\n\nBTW, you can actually buy a brand new WWII vintage Jeep body and source the parts to build yourself a brand new version of the aforementioned.\n\nEdit 2:  There are a few companies out there taking vintage vehicles and converting to electric.  Those were not included because that's just GAY!\n\nReturn to simplicity, at least for a single model or two.  Sales would be through the roof.\n\n\n\nEdit:\n\nhttps://anythingscout.com/pages/project-videos\n\nhttps://www.fj.co/\n\nhttps://www.classicfordbroncos.com/pages/build-a-bronco\n\nhttps://www.autoevolution.com/news/anyone-can-custom-order-a-stunning-and-brand-new-first-gen-bronco-here-s-how-270305.html\n\nhttps://www.velocityrestorations.com/restorations/1973-classic-ford-bronco-5090/\n\nhttps://squarebodyheadquarters.com/brand-new-squarebodys\n\nhttps://brandnewmusclecar.tv/models/\n\nThe following site is for the willis jeep in a crate, but it's a foreign website that may prompt warnings>>\n\nhttps://mdjuan.com.ph/product/kit-in-a-crate-mb/\n\n\n\n", "author": "dataonly", "created": 1791122548590, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "pubestache", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The BIG 3 Should Start Manufacturing Retro Vehicles w/ As Few Options as Possible", "last_comment_created": 1791137747357, "content": "<p>(to meet legal standards and many of those standards should be eliminated.)</p>\n<p>There is a huge and growing boutique industry centered around classic vehicles that were exceptionally popular.  Most of these are either reconditions or totally new chassis and body panels paired w/ LS and sometimes Coyote engines.  These are generally highly equipped and very pricey.</p>\n<p>However, manufacturing true retro with limited options would be a huge profit center for the Big 3.</p>\n<p>BTW, you can actually buy a brand new WWII vintage Jeep body and source the parts to build yourself a brand new version of the aforementioned.</p>\n<p>Edit 2:  There are a few companies out there taking vintage vehicles and converting to electric.  Those were not included because that's just GAY!</p>\n<p>Return to simplicity, at least for a single model or two.  Sales would be through the roof.</p>\n<p>Edit:</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://anythingscout.com/pages/project-videos\" target=\"_blank\">https://anythingscout.com/pages/project-videos</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.fj.co/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fj.co/</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.classicfordbroncos.com/pages/build-a-bronco\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.classicfordbroncos.com/pages/build-a-bronco</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.autoevolution.com/news/anyone-can-custom-order-a-stunning-and-brand-new-first-gen-bronco-here-s-how-270305.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.autoevolution.com/news/anyone-can-custom-order-a-stunning-and-brand-new-first-gen-bronco-here-s-how-270305.html</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.velocityrestorations.com/restorations/1973-classic-ford-bronco-5090/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.velocityrestorations.com/restorations/1973-classic-ford-bronco-5090/</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://squarebodyheadquarters.com/brand-new-squarebodys\" target=\"_blank\">https://squarebodyheadquarters.com/brand-new-squarebodys</a></p>\n<p><a